## PdfFileHandler

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Services`  
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Runtime`  
**Implements**: `IFileHandler`

### Purpose
Handles PDF file attachments in chat messages. Extracts text content from PDF files using the PdfPig library and converts them to `TextContent` for the Semantic Kernel.

### Implementation

```csharp
internal class PdfFileHandler : IFileHandler
{
    public async Task<KernelContent?> GetKernelContent(
        byte[] data, 
        string contentType, 
        string name, 
        IReadOnlyDictionary<string, object?>? metadata = null)
    {
        if (!HandlesType(contentType, name))
            return null;

        using var ms = new MemoryStream(data);
        ms.Position = 0;
        var pdfText = ExtractTextFromPdf(ms, name);
        var c = new TextContent(pdfText, metadata: metadata) { MimeType = contentType };
        return c;
    }

    public string[] GetSupportedMimeTypes() => ["application/pdf"];

    public bool HandlesType(string contentType, string fileName)
    {
        return contentType == "application/pdf" ||
               fileName.EndsWith(".pdf", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase);
    }

    public Dictionary<string, string> GetExtensionMimeTypeMapping()
    {
        return new() { { ".pdf", "application/pdf" } };
    }
}
```

### Text Extraction

```csharp
private string ExtractTextFromPdf(Stream pdfStream, string fileName)
{
    try
    {
        using var document = PdfDocument.Open(pdfStream);
        var textBuilder = new StringBuilder();

        foreach (Page page in document.GetPages())
        {
            textBuilder.AppendLine($"[Page {page.Number}]");
            textBuilder.AppendLine(ContentOrderTextExtractor.GetText(page));
            textBuilder.AppendLine();
        }

        return textBuilder.ToString();
    }
    catch (Exception ex)
    {
        return $"--- PDF: {fileName} ---\nError extracting text: {ex.Message}"";
    }
}
```

### Supported File Types

| Extension | MIME Type | Description |
|-----------|-----------|-------------|
| `.pdf` | `application/pdf` | Portable Document Format |

### Text Extraction Behavior

1. Opens the PDF stream using `PdfDocument.Open()`
2. Iterates through all pages
3. Extracts text in content order using `ContentOrderTextExtractor`
4. Prefixes each page with `[Page {Number}]`
5. Returns concatenated text with page separators
6. On error, returns an error message including the file name

### Error Handling

If text extraction fails (corrupted PDF, unsupported format, etc.), the handler returns a text content with an error message instead of throwing. This ensures the chat can continue even if PDF processing fails.

### Registration

Registered by `ComponentAssistantsPlugin` when `ConnectionInfo.SupportFiles` is true:

```csharp
var info = builder.GetFeatureOption<ConnectionInfo>();
if (info.SupportFiles)
    builder.Services.AddSingleton<IFileHandler, PdfFileHandler>();
```

### Dependencies
- `UglyToad.PdfPig` - PDF parsing and text extraction
- `UglyToad.PdfPig.DocumentLayoutAnalysis.TextExtractor` - Content order extraction

### Related
- `IFileHandler` - Contract (Cyrena.Core)
- `IFileHandlerFactory` - Aggregates all file handlers (Cyrena.Core)
- `ComponentAssistantsPlugin` - Plugin that conditionally registers this handler
- `ConnectionInfo` - Connection capability flags
